### Update with returning clause

Source: https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm-docs/blob/main/src/content/docs/cockroach/update.mdx

Update a row and return specified column values from the updated row in CockroachDB.

```typescript
const updatedUserId = await db.update(users).set({ name: "Mr. Dan" }).where(eq(users.name, "Dan")).returning({ updatedId: users.id });
//      ^ { updatedId: number | null }[]
```

```sql
update "users" set "name" = 'Mr. Dan' where "users"."name" = 'Dan' returning "id";
```

